# Way of the Cryomancer (Bot1, turn 1, off a Black Lotus; Jace token at 5 loyalty, unactivated). On turn 3 Bot1 activates the granted
# "[-3]: When you next cast an instant or sorcery spell this turn, copy that spell" (5 to 2). Bot2 answers by casting Lightning Bolt at
# Bot1: "you cast" means an opponent's spell is not copied, and it does not use the ability up (Delayed still 1): Bot1 takes 3, not 6.
# The ability ends with the turn (CR 603.7b): on turn 5 Bot1's own Lightning Bolt at Bot2 is not copied (Bot2 takes 3, not 6), and
# the Jace token, at 2 loyalty, is refused the -3 again (loyalty must cover it, CR 606.6) while its -1 is offered (the control).

